      "target": "A **LEAGUES OF VOTANN INFANTRY** unit of yours that was hit by any of those attacks.",
      "effect": "Pick a **KAPRICUS** or **SAGITAUR** unit of yours up to 6\" from that **INFANTRY** unit. You can spend 2YP on this use to pick a **HEKATON LAND FORTRESS** unit of yours up to 6\" from it instead. The picked unit can shoot as though in [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), but its models can target only that enemy unit, provided it is eligible."
